          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo go ng'wa Seeba gūnizīīla hangī gūlīhaya: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'wana wa munhū, funyaga būhangi ūhaye gīkī, “Ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bana Kushi na Puti na Lidya na Alabuni ī yose kūja Libya, na a banhū ba mu sī y'ilagano; pye a benaba bakūmalwa būlūgū hamò nī sī ya Misili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu lūshikū lwenūlo nakūtūma nhūng'wa bo meeli kūjūbabbamula a bana Kushi, bīnge ū mu wilendeja wabo. Bakwikīīlwa mayanga mataale ū mu lūshikū lwa lūshilo lwa Misili, nguno ū lwene ng'hana lūlī mu nzīla lwizile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu lūshikū lwa mpungatī ng'weji gwa kwandya, ng'waka gwikūmi na gūmò, mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA gūnizīīla gūlīhaya: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'wana wa munhū, ū nkono go ng'wa Falao ū ntemi wa Misili naagūbīnzile, gūtaalī ū kūtungwa būlūngo gīkī gūpīle, nūūlū gūtaalī kūtūūlīlwa mantī ga būlūngo, gīkī gūdaame gūdūle kūdima lūshū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī, Ū nene nalī ng'wilwisha wakwe ū Falao ū ntemi wa Misili, nakūmīnzagūla pye a makono būbīlī waago; ū nkono ū ndaamu nū yūyo gūbīnzīkile, nantūje ū lūshū lwakwe lūlagale ū mu nkono gwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Bamisili nakūbabbalasanya mu mahanga, nabasambaagīje mu masī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A makono ga ntemi wa Babuloni nakūgaguzuhya, natūūle lūshū lwane ū mu nkono gwake; alīyo a makono ga ng'wa Falao nakūgabīnza, akūng'oola ū kū būtongi bokwe gītī munhū alabūkile ha taale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūgaguzuhya a makono ga ntemi wa Babuloni, alīyo a ga ng'wa Falao gakūsalala. Ūlū nūlūtūūla ū lūshū lwane ū mu nkono gwa ntemi wa Babuloni, hūna wandya kūlūhubenga ū mu Misili, a henaho bakūnideeba gīkī ū nene nalī SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Bamisili nakūbabbalasanya mu mahanga, nabasambaagīje mu masī. Hūna bakūdeeba gīkī ū nene nalī SEEBA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
